	(text "05 J1 (W17-b, IF-2.3 proposed, 2x20 1.27 mm; interfaces.md 9), HV_PERMIT current loop (W16-b), driver enable. Fifth pass: no comparators, no latch. Drivers run only while the HV_PERMIT loop is closed AND HV_ENABLE is high (the control board's heartbeat one-shot); HV_ENABLE is pulled down here, so an unplugged link or a dead control board disables the drivers (DIS high), and the drivers lose +12 V / +3V3 with the link (UVLO). Protection: the control board's firmware on the fast samples, the heartbeat, the PSU's own trip."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0ee5485a-c199-52b3-95c0-249230f89e80")
	)
